paragraph('The executed laboratories establish',r'The computations now connect a genuinely trained multilayer NBO to a continuous-domain economic certificate, compare it with an architecture-matched direct neural HJB solve, and retain a failed joint-loss ablation. Neural preference adjustment, dense nonquadratic capital models, actual trace-estimator training, and dynamic fixed-rival best responses extend the same program beyond exactly representable calibrations. Their error accounts remain distinct: a finite-game equilibrium is not a continuous-game theorem, and sampled high-dimensional residuals do not certify policy payoffs outside their verification region. This separation permits substantive computational progress without changing the economic agenda or treating numerical convenience as an optimality argument.')
paragraph('The primary execution contains 29 recorded experiments:',r'The inherited R2 execution contains 29 recorded experiments and eight regression tests, all retained and rerun. The R6 record adds nine primary stopped-consumption runs, six architecture/update sensitivities, six full-domain certificates, six principal NDU neural runs, sixteen NDU reference sensitivities, twenty-four dense-capital primary fits, six stochastic-trace fits, twelve coverage follow-ups, and six principal dynamic-game solves. Pilot failures and coarse-game counterchecks are retained separately rather than counted as successful primary runs. The original referee diagnostics continue to concern their pinned original sources.')
paragraph('No claim is made here of a reproduced historical',r'The R6 directory contains complete source, generated tables, model and numerical arrays, optimizer histories, certificate covers, tests, and a provenance manifest. The replication workflow materializes the revision source, independently reruns its computations, and commits the resulting evidence only to the designated R6 candidate branch; an exact-source snapshot and raw-result hashes identify each execution. Local execution, remote replication, and independent referee acceptance remain different facts. No historical GPU benchmark, unexecuted deep-BSDE comparison, unrestricted neural Cournot equilibrium, or empirical identification result is inferred from the computations reported here.')
